From 42b40b6ff40639eef2a46e12e90463af6f8495fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 10:55:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add bounded socket-free V2 block download coordinator

Track requested peer/BlockID lifecycles through full, compact, missing and deferred recovery. Preserve typed capacity, consensus and operational outcomes; reserve bounded cache and simultaneous fallback staging before copies, and retain bounded connection tombstones until disconnect.

Standalone Debug and AddressSanitizer/UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer CTest pass, including real full/compact byte parity, per-peer/global quotas, deferred recovery, callback/destructor reentry and 220 allocation-failure positions with exact lease cleanup. No sockets, profile adoption, shared build edits or consensus-serving claims.
